    "1.20.1-5.0.11": "Fix wrong nullity annotation. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.20.1-5.0.12": "- [Make the patchouli provider actually work correctly when extending foreign books.](https://github.com/ModdingX/LibX/commit/b0278b36317f59b7aa2ceedb4774d559f827eacf) - *noeppi_noeppi*",
    "1.20.1-5.0.13": "Add some more polynomial methods. - noeppi_noeppi\nAdd fixed codecs and implement toString in LibX codecs. - noeppi_noeppi",
    "1.20.1-5.0.14": "fix items are in creative tab even if default behaviour is overridden - MelanX"
